iler":false,"text":"お姉ちゃんが大好きで、ずっとお姉ちゃんと一緒に過ごしてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親がいないことの多い家の中で、基本的に家事は彼女がこなしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が昔からエライと評価されているのは知っているが、その評価は本人にとって、少し重荷に感じる部分がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3257","sourceWorkId":"19876","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会で生まれ都会で育った、都会っ娘シスターズの妹。 後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことで知り合い、フレンドリーなタメ口で会話をするが、先輩ということが分かると敬語で話し、きちんと年上を立ててくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るくハキハキしたしっかり者で、人のために何かしてあげるのが好き。 エッチでも尽くすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、素直じゃない部分を持っており、ストレートにお礼を言われたりするのが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ショッピングが好きで、オシャレが趣味。 映画を見るのも好きで、よく映画館に足を運んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お姉ちゃんが大好きで、ずっとお姉ちゃんと一緒に過ごしてきた。 両親がいないことの多い家の中では、基本的に家事は彼女がこなしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が昔からエライと評価されているのは知っているが、その評価は本人にとって、少し重荷に感じる部分がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「一緒に映画行かない？　面白そうなのが上映中なの！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24288"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24288","value":"霧島学園 1年A組"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3257","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3257","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3257","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3257","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ebe5785a1c6a62a9b65e1a2f4a2161e347ca39a9460553b6984a23ad3a63b72.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e90081982c01c7f156002c850da6be24432903b0540adee7259fb21aae1c7da3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:93361:24288:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:56364","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16744","characterName":"薬王寺 小町","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"24290","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"93361"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3259"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16744"},"originalCharacterName":"薬王寺 小町","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"805"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"106"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A modern Japanese teacher who has Yamato Nadeshiko-like qualities and the sensibility of a woman from the countryside who receives looks from the nearby students. Even though she came to the city earlier than the main character, she still hasn't adjusted to the city life yet. She gets lost at large train stations, takes the stairs in tall buildings, and can't walk in a crowd of people. Because Komachi is from the countryside, she loves the outdoors, and although she hasn't been able to do so recently, her hobbies are hiking and camping."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes buying stuff and, since the city has a lot of stuff, can't help but stay."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Komachi was always helping around the house and busy with studying to be a teacher when she was a student so she hasn't had much of a chance to meet men. That's why she doesn't know much about how to deal with them. It seems like it will be a while before she will have sex with anyone but in reality she is very interested and is the one looking forward to it the most out of all the heroines."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her distinguishing feature are her breasts which are over 100cm and reaches the level of being a weapon."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16744"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和撫子的奥ゆかしさを持ちつつ、田舎から出てきた少女らしさを持つ、生徒たちと近めの視線で接することが出来る、現代文の先生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公より前に上京してきているが、今でも都会に翻弄されていて、大きな駅では迷い、ビル郡では見上げて歩き、人ごみでは前に進めない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近はあまり行けていないが、田舎で育ったためか、アウトドアが大好きで、登山やキャンプが趣味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は、物が多い都会で、買い物に行くことが楽しくて仕方ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家の旅館の手伝いと、教師になるための勉強で忙しく、男性とつきあったこともないし、接する機会も多くなかったため、男性のことをろくに知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｈとは程遠いように見えるが、その実興味津々で、実は一番Ｈに前向きなキャラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"１００ｃｍを超えるその圧巻の胸は、もはや凶器のレベル。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3259","sourceWorkId":"19876","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和撫子的奥ゆかしさと、田舎から出てきた少女らしさを持つ、学生たちと近めの視線で接することが出来る現代文の先生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公より前に上京してきているが、今でも都会に翻弄されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大きな駅では迷い、ビル郡では見上げて歩き、人ごみでは前に進めない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし都会は物が多いので、買い物に行くことが楽しくて仕方ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は行けていないが、田舎で育ったためかアウトドアが大好きで、登山やキャンプが趣味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代は実家の旅館の手伝いと、教師になるための勉強で忙しく、男性と付き合うどころか接する機会も多くなかったため、男性のことをろくに知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチとは程遠いように見えるが、その実興味津々で、実は一番エッチに前向きなキャラ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"100cmを超えるその圧巻の胸は、もはや凶器のレベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もう……みんな何かにつけて、胸がー、胸がーって…… あ、今見てたでしょ!?」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24290"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24290","value":"霧島学園 現代文教師"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"106 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3259","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3259","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3259","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"63 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3259","sourceWorkId":"19876","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce79892bcf7650bce433828aca2b17701d4b2b8dc3e8b18ded041ff44ec38918.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e1798be74c1bd36c951298412f451f32a6051a65fa5d6dd9200739d76b95729.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:93361:24290:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65754","characterName":"黒鉄 道","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65754"},"originalCharacterName":"黒鉄 道","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A reserved guy who is a second-year at Kirishima Academy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65754"}],"profileFacts":[],